  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "Dissolve ingredients except glucose and reducing agents. Prepare medium anaerobically under a 100% N2 gas--atmosphere, adjust pH to 7.0, dispense in anaerobic vials (1/3 vol.) and autoclave. Add glucose, cysteine and sulfide from sterile, anoxic stock solutions prepared under N2."
    }
  ]
